Package: rfetch
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: babichgh <john@babich.pw>
Depends: libc6, libgcc-s1
Homepage: https://github.com/babichgh/Rfetch
Description: A fastfetch clone written in Rust
 Rfetch prints system information next to a logo for the running
 distribution. Logo artwork is vendored from fastfetch (MIT).
 .
 Logo art comes from fastfetch and is MIT licensed; its full text is
 installed at /usr/share/doc/rfetch/LICENSE-fastfetch.